    "displayRule": {
      "coupledTrainRow": "Show one umbrella train row named with the Japanese middle dot, for example A・B, whenever reviewed coupled portions represent one physical passenger train at the boarding point. Selecting it goes directly to alighting stations; do not show an extra branch/portion picker.",
